;; English — the reference translation.
;;
;; Every other file in this folder is a translation of this one. Keys whose
;; value is a map have singular and plural forms; which one is used is decided
;; per language in csv-cleaver.i18n/plural-category, so a translator never has
;; to think about it. {0}, {1} … are filled in by the application, and must
;; survive translation.
;;
;; Nothing here appears in any Clojure source file. Correcting a phrase means
;; editing this file and rebuilding, nothing more.

